// Dialog :
"P693138975" "You're finished at the safe house. Time to tell Gaussian what you've learned."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3783511015" "<color deepskyblue>The Red and the Black<br>Part: Two<br><br></color>From what you found, the situation with the renegades is worse than I suspected. And now Longbow has a stake in it. Tendaji's a good guy, but the murder of Mr. Wylde is too much. He's going to go to 'W.M. Dietrich', and then there's going to be trouble. But we have to concentrate on putting down these renegades first and that means stopping the assassination attempt on Lady Grey. Or does it? Hmmm... You know, I've got an idea..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3361501064" "<color deepskyblue>The Red and the Black<br>Part: Three<br><br></color>Here's the plan, {HeroName}. The Renegades are gathering a large number of their forces for an assassination attempt on Lady Grey. I've talked to her and she's going to walk right into the trap. Only now the trap is for them, not for her. You're going to be there as her back-up, you and any allies you want to bring. We're going to break this conspiracy and put an end to this today."
// AcceptString :
"P203949917" "Spring the trap on the Renegade Swords"
// SendOffString :
"P1515261979" "<color deepskyblue>The Red and the Black<br>Part: Three<br><br></color>The Renegades planned to get Lady Grey alone and then swarm her with hit-squads. They might have had a chance, too, but not anymore. You have two objectives: first, you have to get Lady Grey to safety. If she falls, even if we're able to miniport her back out, that still will count as a victory for the Renegades. Your secondary objective is to eliminate all the assassin squads. Good luck."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3149138029" "Trap the Renegades"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1775240716" "<color deepskyblue>The Red and the Black<br>Part: Three<br><br></color>Remember, Lady Grey has to get out in one piece and you have to demolish all of the assassin squads."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1325991473" "Lady Grey is waiting as the bait in this trap. Time to spring it!"

