"P577977714" "Lady Grey fell in battle. Though she was teleported to a hospital, the Renegades have still achieved a psychological victory."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2123558217" "<color deepskyblue>The Red and the Black<br>Part: Three<br><br></color>Good job! The Renegades are sure to get desperate now, and that may draw them out and give us a chance to put an end to them. That is, unless someone does something stupid..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P487973320" "<color deepskyblue>The Red and the Black<br>Part: Three<br><br></color>Lady Grey will recover, but she's out of it for the moment. The Watcher has a stand-in taking her place for a few days until she recovers. Which means he knew he'd need a stand-in. I don't know how, and honestly, I don't think I really want to know. However, this may provide us with an opportunity to draw out the Renegades. That is, unless someone does something stupid..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1807480693" "<color deepskyblue>The Red and the Black<br>Part: Four<br><br></color>With their attempt on Lady Grey a failure, the Renegade Sword units are on edge. They're making mistakes and now one of their key intelligence officers, Captain Racer, is exposed. Your mission is to catch him and bring him in."
// AcceptString :
"P2423452314" "Capture Captain Racer"
// SendOffString :
"P3877798357" "<color deepskyblue>The Red and the Black<br>Part: Four<br><br></color>We need to know what the Renegades are doing and what they plan to do next. You'll have to take care of any opposition on-site, but keep on-task. We need to find out their plans."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1054354275" "Catch Captain Racer"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3487127442" "<color deepskyblue>The Red and the Black<br>Part: Four<br><br></color>I know it may be tough, but we've got to know the Renegades' plans."

